<title>USA: Knape &amp; Vogt settles patent suit.</title>
<headline>Knape &amp; Vogt settles patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Knape &amp; Vogt Manufacturing Co said Thursday it reached an agreement to settle its patent infringement suit against Accuride International Inc.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in June in Grand Rapids, Mich., focused on a patent feature of the KV 8400 precision drawer slide.</p>
<p>While Accuride denies it infringed any KV patent, the parties have agreed that certain design changes by Accuride would satisfactorily resolve the dispute.</p>
<p>Knape &amp; Vogt manufactures wall-attached and freestanding shelving and a variety of storage items.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
